Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.43,0:00:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going no you're not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because, as I've already explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if a veil has been cast then there\Nis a strong likelihood that he's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still alive and he's there at\NSakurazaka High School. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon i'm ordering you to wait there\Nfor me it adori it was probably
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pointless to even ask him that\Nas you heard i need to go so i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave this to you you know what what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why is that a problem well um it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just that um there's a lot of them\Nand i think they're all humans i
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:01:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was thinking of recommending you\Nfor promotion to grade one sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.24,0:01:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right let's get this\Ndone baby please step
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aside egg don't forget that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our job is to help others
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though you're a student,\Nthat includes even you, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to make any more mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't go there, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.14,0:01:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, E.G.G.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.31,0:01:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Junpei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu Sorcerer, back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jellyfish
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shikigami blunt
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacks won't even touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's inside that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Jujutsu sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't tell me what my business is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really of saving indiscriminately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't overestimate the value of a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People always pretend their\Nemotions are everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the heart is just the\Nmetabolism of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all a delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't restrict me with rules\Nthat are based on a delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives anyone the right to\Nstop someone from taking a life?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just go sleep over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something I\Nhave to go back and do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your cursed technique is poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You produce poison from cursed energy\Nand then your shikigami secretes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you will learn how\Nto control their size
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and their strength and that of the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A normal jujutsu sorcerer would\Nneed some time to grasp it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll teach you the sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you'll be able to fight right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Junpei, you have talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you trying to convince here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't Moondrake's\Npoison work on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,getting in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:06:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he can't dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I have a chance to crush him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just before he lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Junpei,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really can't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single thing you're saying\Nstring together whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,logic you want with shikigami\Nstrike the sorcerer directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all you're doing is trying to convince
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself you're on the right side of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I don't know\Nwhy you're doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll assume you have a good reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it really worth\Nthrowing away the life that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:07:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have the human heart\Nis just a delusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you really say that\Nin front of our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People don't have hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still— They don't! Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise... That would mean people\Ncursed me and my mom with those hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would just be too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I wouldn't even know what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is right and what's wrong anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you dodge it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said a lot of arrogant stuff\Nwithout really understanding anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I swear to you, if you do,\Nthen I won't curse you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way Your mom
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Junpei
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Join Jujutsu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tech, you'd like it. There are lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of crazy strong teachers And good\Nreliable friends there If we all work
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together I guarantee you We can find\Nwhoever it was that cursed your mom
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can make them pay for what they
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did Let's fight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.94,0:09:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you No This
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feels like Vessel of Sukuna Mahito, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't do it. What am I an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,human-shaped cursed spirit with a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,patchwork face this is exactly what\Nnanami told me what happened jupe get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out i don't care what your relationship\Nis with him right now just get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your ass out of here run itadori
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,calm down, my heat is not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad person
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know Junpei
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a pretty smart kid
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:10:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sometimes thinking too much Can\Nlead to even more foolish decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Than impulsiveness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a classic case\Nof that. I'd even say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you can actually be almost as foolish\Nas those people you call fools yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idle transfiguration.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!
